       For D, use square bbox, ensure mask == mask.T but != flip_ud(mask) and != flip_lr(mask).
    4. Place objects on the grid with min L1 separation >= 4 between them.
    5. Scatter 3-9 singleton red pixels with min L1 >= 3 from any multi-cell object.
    6. Color everything red (2) to form the input.
    7. Output = recolor multi-cell objects by symmetry type, erase singletons.
